  "summary": "Principal Technical Architect and Presales Director with 20+ years delivering multi-million cloud, security and AI transformations across AWS, Azure, GCP, telecom, defence and enterprise. Founder of an independent consultancy group (Stars4Business OÜ / S4Biz / Cybergod LLC) engaged director-level by NetApp, AWS, Enea, Tosca, Intellexa, ZEDEDA, Luxair, Infineon and Colt. Designed, coded and shipped cybergod.ai — a production multi-LLM cyber-risk platform. Expert in Zero Trust / SASE / SD-WAN, DevSecOps, Kubernetes and offensive-cyber programmes. MEDDPICC-led; DORA, NIS2, CRA, EU AI Act and GDPR aware. Fluent English, German, Russian, Hebrew.",
